        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Enlightenment</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">Arose in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch-republic">Dutch Republic</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>; flourished in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/edinburgh">Edinburgh</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/berlin">Berlin</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/konigsberg">Königsberg</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/milan">Milan</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/naples">Naples</a>, and spread to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a>, Portugal, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poland">Poland</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/americas">Americas</a></span></div>
